      "note": "HOOK for L5v2: the fire__ nodes' flame cards. Draw additive (blending Additive, depthWrite false, double-sided), unlit; COLOR_0.rgb = emissive colour, COLOR_0.a = soft edge (0 at the rim); TEXCOORD_0.x = across the card (-1..1), TEXCOORD_0.y = height up the flame (0..1): flicker by scrolling a noise texture up y and scaling alpha/brightness with it (time uniform), 0.6–1.2 Hz with a faster 7 Hz jitter. The node fire__<unit>_light marks a warm point light (2200 K, ~180 cd, range 6 m) to flicker in step; L6 bakes its steady part into the hearth and floor."
